{
    "name": "道路",
    "category": "tfg:logistics",
    "icon": "rnr:rock/sett_road/quartzite",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#intro)道路修筑$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#mattock)鹤嘴锄$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#base_course)基层$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#pavers)铺面材料$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#hoggin)碎石混合料$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#gravel_fill)砾石填料$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#stone)圆石、仿石砖与铺路砖$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#concrete)混凝土$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#asphalt)沥青$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#paving_cart)铺路车$()",
            "title": "目录",
            "anchor": "index"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "title": "简介",
            "text": "修筑道路对提升陆路运输效率至关重要，包含三个基本步骤：$(li)$(bold)1：$()用$(l:logistics/roads#mattock)鹤嘴锄$()夯实原状土壤。$(li)$(bold)2：$()铺设$(l:logistics/roads#base_course)碎石基层$()。$(li)$(bold)3：$()铺上路面$(l:logistics/roads#pavers)铺面材料$()。$(br)不同种类的道路使用不同的材料。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "item": "tag:rnr:mattocks",
            "title": "鹤嘴锄",
            "anchor": "mattock",
            "text": "鹤嘴锄可以像$(l:craftsmanship/chisel)凿子$()一样用在泥土类方块上。在默认的方块模式下，对这类方块按 $(item)$(k:key.use)$() 即可将其夯实。如果鹤嘴锄夯实的是泥土或泥根，得到的夯实泥土必须再铺上碎石基层予以修整。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "item": "rnr:crushed_base_course",
            "title": "基层",
            "anchor": "base_course",
            "text": "当地土壤夯实后，下一步就是为道路铺设基层。碎石基层可以用砾石或石粉与石子混合制成，对已夯实的方块按 $(item)$(k:key.use)$() 即可铺设。这层碎石基层会形成坚固的基础，供最终的步行路面承载其上。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "item": "tag:rnr:road_materials",
            "title": "铺面材料",
            "anchor": "pavers",
            "text": "筑路的最后一步是铺设路面。不同的物品——包括$(l:logistics/roads#stone)砖$()、$(l:logistics/roads#hoggin)碎石$()和$(l:logistics/roads#stone)石子$()——都可以通过 $(item)$(k:key.use)$() 铺在基层上，形成可行走的道路。不同的物品会形成不同种类的道路，而不同种类的道路会提供不同的行走速度加成。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "夯实、铺设基层、再用砖铺面的筑路流程。",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
                    "pattern": [
